</p>
</div>
<!-- END REFERENCES --></div></div><script>$RC("B:3","S:3")</script><div hidden id="S:4"><div class="col-12 " id="34119723-049c-4a55-85b6-682e9e1f04aa"><h4 aria-level="2">Related Features</h4><ul class="black-text-list"><li><a href="/en/publications/fandd/issues/2024/09/america-must-rediscover-its-dynamism-michael-peters">America Must Rediscover Its Dynamism</a></li><li><a href="/en/publications/fandd/issues/2024/09/point-of-view-mass-flourishing-and-economic-dynamism-edmund-phelps">Mass Flourishing and Economic Dynamism</a></li><li><a href="/en/publications/fandd/issues/2024/03/symposium-economics-and-innovation-michael-kremer">Economics and Innovation</a></li><li><a href="/en/publications/fandd/issues/2024/09/back-to-basics-total-factor-productivity-robert-zymek">Total Factor Productivity</a></li></ul></div></div><script>$RC("B:4","S:4")</script><div hidden id="S:5"><div id="08e8a430-dbc2-400b-97a0-cb723b83b078" class="full-width padded-vertical-20 bg-lightest-grey col-12 "><div class="contain-70"><h5 aria-level="2">Latest Issues</h5></div><div class="contain-70 flex-container" role="list"><div class="cell-2 belt-item" role="listitem"><a href="https://www.imf.org/en/publications/fandd/issues/2026/03" title="March 2026"><img alt="" width="600" height="805" class="" src="https://www.imf.org/-/media/images/imf/fandd/issue-covers/2026/fd-cover-mar26.jpg?h=805&amp;iar=0&amp;w=600"/></a><div class="belt-caption"><h6 aria-level="3">March 2026</h6><div class="coveo-no-index dropdown"><button aria-label="English, choose a language" aria-controls="list-languages-undefined" aria-expanded="false" class="dropbtn">English<i class="fal fa-chevron-down"></i></button><div role="list" id="list-languages-undefined" data-testid="list-languages-undefined" class="dropdown-content" aria-label="Choose a language"><div lang="zh" role="listitem"><a lang="zh" href="/zh/publications/fandd/issues/2026/03?path=publications%2Cfandd%2Cissues%2C2024%2C09%2Cthe-innovation-paradox-ufuk-akcigit">中文<